# Roadmap

## Milestone: v1.0 MVP Launch — 0% (0/4) (tnib-m001)

> Ship the minimum viable product with core task management, user authentication, basic dashboard, and API foundation.

### Epic: User Authentication — 17% (1/6) (tnib-e001)


- ![bug](https://img.shields.io/badge/bug-d73a4a?style=flat-square) OAuth callback URL mismatch in production config (tnib-b001)
- ![bug](https://img.shields.io/badge/bug-d73a4a?style=flat-square) Session tokens not invalidated on password change (tnib-b002)
- ![feature](https://img.shields.io/badge/feature-0e8a16?style=flat-square) OAuth2 social login (tnib-f002)
- ![feature](https://img.shields.io/badge/feature-0e8a16?style=flat-square) Password reset flow (tnib-f003)
- ![feature](https://img.shields.io/badge/feature-0e8a16?style=flat-square) Email/password login (tnib-f001)
- ![task](https://img.shields.io/badge/task-1d76db?style=flat-square) Write authentication API documentation (tnib-t008)
